-\frac{\hbar^{2}}{2m^{*}}\frac{2}{\Delta z}\left(\frac{\psi_{2}-\psi_{1}}{\Delta z}-\alpha_{0}\psi_{1}-\beta_{0}\right)+U_{1}\psi_{1} & =E\psi_{1}
